### ============================================
### AUTHENTICATION & LOGIN FLOW
### ============================================
### File khusus untuk mendapatkan JWT Token dari Keycloak
### Gunakan ini terlebih dahulu sebelum test endpoint lainnya

### VARIABLES
@keycloakUrl = http://localhost:8080/realms/smk3/protocol/openid-connect
@adminUsername = isi-username-admin
@adminPassword = isi-password-admin
@siswaUsername = isi-username-siswa
@siswaPassword = isi-password-siswa
@guruUsername = isi-username-guru
@guruPassword = isi-password-guru
@clientId = api-gateway
@clientSecret = your-client-secret-here

---

### ============================================
### 1. LOGIN ADMIN
### ============================================

### 🔐 GET TOKEN - ADMIN
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=password&username={{adminUsername}}&password={{adminPassword}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

### Response akan berisi:
### {
###   "access_token": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "refresh_token": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "token_type": "Bearer",
###   "expires_in": 300
### }

### COPY access_token dan paste ke @token di api.http

---

### ============================================
### 2. LOGIN SISWA
### ============================================

### 🔐 GET TOKEN - SISWA
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=password&username={{siswaUsername}}&password={{siswaPassword}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

---

### ============================================
### 3. LOGIN GURU
### ============================================

### 🔐 GET TOKEN - GURU
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=password&username={{guruUsername}}&password={{guruPassword}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

---

### ============================================
### 4. REFRESH TOKEN
### ============================================

### 🔄 REFRESH TOKEN (Jika token expired)
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=<PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN>&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

---

### ============================================
### 5. VALIDATE TOKEN
### ============================================

### ✅ INTROSPECT TOKEN (Check if valid)
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/introspect
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&token=<PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN>&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

### Response:
### {
###   "exp": 1716384261,
###   "iat": 1716383961,
###   "auth_time": 1716383961,
###   "jti": "abc123...",
###   "iss": "http://localhost:8080/realms/smk3",
###   "sub": "user-uuid",
###   "typ": "Bearer",
###   "azp": "api-gateway",
###   "session_state": "xxx",
###   "acr": "1",
###   "email": "admin@smk3.sch.id",
###   "name": "Administrator",
###   "preferred_username": "admin",
###   "given_name": "Admin",
###   "family_name": "Istrator",
###   "email_verified": true,
###   "active": true
### }

---

### ============================================
### 6. LOGOUT / REVOKE TOKEN
### ============================================

### 🚪 LOGOUT - REVOKE TOKEN
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/logout
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&refresh_token=<PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN>&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

---

### ============================================
### STEP-BY-STEP GUIDE
### ============================================

### 1. Klik "Send Request" pada "GET TOKEN - ADMIN"

### 2. Copy access_token dari response JSON
###    Contoh: "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCIg..."

### 3. Buka file api.http

### 4. Ubah variabel @token:
###    @token = eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCIg...

### 5. Sekarang Anda bisa test endpoint yang perlu autentikasi

### 6. Jika token expired (response 401):
###    - Klik "Send Request" pada "GET TOKEN - ADMIN" lagi
###    - Update @token dengan token baru

---

### ============================================
### TIPS KEAMANAN
### ============================================

### ⚠️ JANGAN:
### - Jangan push file .http dengan token real ke git
### - Jangan share token ke orang lain
### - Jangan commit file ini jika ada secret

### ✅ LAKUKAN:
### - Setup @clientSecret dari environment variable
### - Gunakan .env file untuk credentials
### - Refresh token sebelum expired
### - Logout setelah selesai testing

---

### ============================================
### DECODE JWT TOKEN
### ============================================

### Gunakan https://jwt.io untuk decode token
### Paste access_token yang Anda dapat
### Akan melihat:
### {
###   "exp": 1716384261,
###   "iat": 1716383961,
###   "sub": "uuid-user",
###   "preferred_username": "admin",
###   "email": "admin@smk3.sch.id",
###   "roles": ["ADMIN"],
###   ...
### }

### Bagian "sub" adalah user_id
### Bagian "roles" adalah role user

---

### ============================================
### KEYCLOAK CONFIG
### ============================================

### Keycloak URL: http://localhost:8080
### Admin Console: http://localhost:8080/admin
### Realm: smk3
### Client ID: api-gateway

### Default Users (setup di docker-compose):
### - admin Keycloak sesuai KC_ADMIN / KC_ADMIN_PASSWORD di .env
### - Akun aplikasi dibuat lewat tools/setup-master-admin.mjs

---

### ============================================
### TROUBLESHOOTING
### ============================================

### ERROR: "invalid_client_id"
### SOLUSI: Pastikan client_id = api-gateway

### ERROR: "invalid_grant"
### SOLUSI: Username/password salah

### ERROR: "Client authentication failed"
### SOLUSI: client_secret tidak cocok

### ERROR: "Realm does not exist"
### SOLUSI: Realm name harus "smk3"

### ERROR: "Connection refused on localhost:8080"
### SOLUSI: Keycloak belum berjalan
### - Jalankan: docker-compose up keycloak

---

